  "methodology_description": "This fictional preview ranks individual killers and survivors on separate boards. Scores describe current-season performance among players eligible when the snapshot is generated; they are hand-authored examples, not model output or a proposed production formula. Entry ratings determine eligibility and do not directly contribute to ranking scores. Killers require an entry rating of at least 1200 points and more than 10 matches against eligible survivor players. Survivors require an entry rating of at least 300 points and more than 5 matches against eligible killer players. Each qualifying match counts once per player, regardless of opposing player count or party size. All shown players meet their board's requirements at generation time. No repeat-encounter limits apply; all repeated matches remain included. Result counts describe the outcome of each player's side, not whether that survivor personally escaped. Party membership records who queued together in that match and does not create a shared rating or ranked group. Each killer counts opposing survivor players individually; each survivor counts opposing killer players. Teammates are not opponents.",
